@format 1
@id section-creation.split-selected-section
@title Split selected section
@section Section creation
@area In Split tab
@entry split-dispatch
@summary Create the new right-hand section produced by splitting the selected section at the cursor; the required shortening of the original left half is included only as part of this creation operation.
@related section-creation.common.compass-buttons, section-creation.common.keyboard-shortcuts, section-creation.common.apply-created-state
@tag section
@tag split
@tag creation
@tag divide

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias segment = Cadroue.Application.LSegment
@alias piece = Cadroue.Core.LPiece

[split-dispatch] splitSection dispatch request <input>
~ This starts with splitSection dispatch request.
[Technical explanation]
= The request came from the Split Compass Split button or the currently bound SectionSplit shortcut.
> dispatch-guard

[dispatch-guard] Active Split flow guard <decision>
~ The program checks active Split flow guard.
[Technical explanation]
- PFlowShortcutDispatch requires a command-active flow with a loaded spool and active section UI before invoking PFlowSectionDivide @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...) / splitSection
? "Rejected" > dispatch-rejected
? "Accepted" > divide-handler

[dispatch-rejected] Split command ignored <output>
~ This path ends with split command ignored.
[Technical explanation]
= No section operation is called.

[divide-handler] Prepare section division <decision>
~ The program checks prepare section division.
[Technical explanation]
- PFlowSectionDivide requires section editing to be enabled, resets pFlowSegmentFired, chooses the color from current section count modulo active palette count, and calls LSegmentDivide at the current cursor @ flow.PFlowSectionDivide(...)
@ flow.PFlowColorRead(...)
? "Editing disabled" > divide-rejected
? "Division requested" > segment-divide

[divide-rejected] Split creation blocked <output>
~ This path ends with split creation blocked.
[Technical explanation]
= No section state changes.

[segment-divide] Validate selection and cursor position <decision>
~ The program checks validate selection and cursor position.
[Technical explanation]
- LSegmentDivide asks LPieceDivide for a plan; LPieceDivide requires an active section and a cursor strictly inside its start/end bounds @ segment.LSegmentDivide(...)
@ piece.LPieceDivide(...)
? "No selected section or cursor not strictly inside" > divide-invalid
? "Cursor strictly inside selected section" > split-plan

[divide-invalid] No split plan <output>
~ This path ends with no split plan.
[Technical explanation]
= No new section is created.

[split-plan] Replace one section with left and right halves <process>
~ This step handles replace one section with left and right halves.
[Technical explanation]
- Remove the selected piece, insert the original piece shortened to end at the cursor as the left half, insert a new unnamed right half from cursor to the original end using the new color, and keep the left-half index active @ piece.LPieceDivide(...)
> map:section-creation.common.apply-created-state
